  "abstract": "Computes initial trunk gradient ratio R_vp = ||\u2207_trunk L_value|| / ||\u2207_trunk L_policy|| for PPO at grid of policy/value clip ranges and \u03b1\u2208{0.20,0.33}. Reports table to STDOUT and returns JSON.",
